; Comments, brackets and word boundaries for the "daml" content type, from a language
; configuration file. Only the configuration is registered, never a TextMate grammar: colouring
; comes from our own classifier and a grammar would paint over it.
; $PackageFolder$ is the folder of this pkgdef, which is where the json sits too.
[$RootKey$\TextMate\LanguageConfiguration\ContentTypeMapping]
"daml"="$PackageFolder$\daml-language-configuration.json"
